    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d34">

                <pb facs="0036" n="24" sameAs="frus:frus1941v01/pg24"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 European War 1939/10470: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Steinhardt</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                        Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1941-04-30T12:00:00+03:00">April 30,
                            1941—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received April 30—11:20 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>880. <hi rendition="#italic">Pravda</hi> today published the following despatch
                    from its Tallinn correspondent: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“According to trustworthy information received here on April 26th, four
                            German transports arrived in the Finnish port of Abo (Turku) from which
                            were disembarked approximately 12,000 German troops equipped with arms,
                            tanks, artillery, etc. On April 28th these troops began to leave for
                                Tampere.”<anchor n="68" xml:id="d34-f1"/>
                        </p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <p>Repeated to Helsinki.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Steinhardt</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d34-f1" n="68" xml:id="d34-f1-content">
                <p>Tammerfors.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
